components.description:
For the Point-7 Black Team, the curve is the first priority. It’s not just about the latest trend or a "new generation" design—it’s about creating the perfect ergonomic position for both your front and back arms. This allows you to sail effortlessly, with the boom naturally positioning the sail at the right angle for optimal airflow.
Natural arm positioning – Reduces strain and keeps you comfortable through every session
Automatic sail angle alignment – Ensures the wind enters and exits the sail with maximum efficiency
Tailored per size and discipline – Each boom is developed for specific conditions, optimizing your performance in any wind strength or windsurfing style
This curve isn’t just a design feature—it’s an essential element that enhances comfort, reduces fatigue, and maximizes control.

BREAKAGE RATE 0,05%! 
